00:03:49.655 --> 00:03:51.020
The Reference Platform:

77
00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:53.263
A Grocery Marketplace for India.

78
00:03:54.513 --> 00:03:58.118
Every chapter uses one system so that concepts compound.

79
00:03:58.398 --> 00:04:06.121
You learn caching on the catalog, then see that same cache break when inventory changes during a flash sale in Chapter 46.

80
00:04:07.471 --> 00:04:09.071
Business in one paragraph.

81
00:04:09.351 --> 00:04:12.359
Customers order groceries in a mobile or web app.

82
00:04:12.639 --> 00:04:22.857
Orders are fulfilled from dark stores (small warehouses) and third-party sellers, and delivered by the platform's own delivery fleet in scheduled or express slots.

83
00:04:23.137 --> 00:04:28.812
Payments go through Razorpay (UPI, cards, netbanking, wallets) or cash on delivery.

84
00:04:29.092 --> 00:04:32.100
Every order produces a GST-compliant invoice.

85
00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:35.559
Serviceability is decided by 6-digit pincode.

86
00:04:35.839 --> 00:04:38.185
Login is mobile number + OTP.

87
00:04:39.535 --> 00:04:41.477
Scale assumptions used in the book.

88
