00:17:46.761 --> 00:17:55.529
Read the question and give your answer out loud or on paper, timed (60 s for B1 or B2, 3 min for B3 or B4).

446
00:17:55.809 --> 00:17:59.777
Expand the answer and compare it against the 30-second answer first.

